          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Heizung is built on the verb heizen 'to heat', inherited from Old High German heizen and Proto-Germanic haitijaną (EtymDB), a cousin of German heiß 'hot'."
            }
          ]
        },
